  <text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
    <body>

        <div xml:id="AN210.1-kilavi">
          <p type="edition">tōḻi talaimakaṉ ciṟaippuṟamākat talaimakaṭkuc colluvāḷāyc colliyatu.</p>
          <p type="translation" xml:lang="en">What the confidante said as one who is talking to HER when HE was behind the hedge.</p>
        </div>
        <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="AN210.1">
        <l>kuṟiyiṟaik kurampaik kolaivem paratava</l>
        <l>reṟiyu<supplied>ḷi</supplied> poruta vēmuṟu peru<supplied>mī</supplied>ṉ</l>
        <l>puṇṇumiḻ kuruti pulavukkaṭal maṟuppaṭa</l>
        <l>vicumpaṇi villiṟ pōkip pacumpitirt</l>
        <l>tiraipayi laḻuva muḻakki yuraṉaḻintu</l>
        <l>niraitimil maruṅkiṟ paṭartarun tuṟaivaṉ</l>
        <l>pāṉā ḷiraviṉam paṇaittō ḷuḷḷit</l>
        <l>tā<supplied>ṉi</supplied>vaṇ vanta kālai nammūrk</l>
        <l>kāṉalam peruntuṟaik kaviṉpā<anchor n="1"/> rāṭṭi</l>
        <l>yāṉātu pukaḻntici ṉōṉē yiṉittaṉ</l>
        <l>cāyaṉ mārpiṟ pāyaṉ māṟṟik</l>
        <l>kaitaiyam paṭuciṉaik kaṭuntēr vilaṅkac</l>
        <l>celavari teṉṉu meṉpatu</l>
        <l>palakēṭ ṭaṉamāṟ ṟōḻi nāmē.</l>
      </lg>
      <lg type="translation" xml:lang="en">
        <l rend="indent6" corresp="6d">The man from the ghat,</l>
        <l corresp="2">where the big fish, maddened when struck by the hook thrown</l>
        <l corresp="1">by the fishermen keen on killing, with [their] short-eaved huts,</l>
        <l corresp="4a-c">moves like the sky-adorning [rain]bow,</l>
        <l corresp="3">so that the fish-reeking sea is changed by the blood shooting forth from [its] wound,</l>
        <l corresp="4d-5">strength failing, disturbing the expanse dense with waves of green spray,</l>
        <l corresp="6a-c">[and] sets out for the boats in rows,</l>
        <l corresp="10a-c">he was one to praise unendingly,</l>
        <l corresp="9">appreciating the beauty of the big ghat by the seashore grove</l>
        <l corresp="8">of our village, at the time he came here,</l>
        <l corresp="7">remembering our bamboo shoulders at midnight.</l>
        <l rend="indent6" corresp="10d">Now,</l>
        <l corresp="13c-14">we have heard [him] saying many [times], friend,</l>
        <l corresp="11">denying [us] sleep on his graceful chest,</l>
        <l corresp="13ab">that going [is] difficult,</l>
        <l corresp="12">when [his] fast chariot is hindered by the hanging Kaitai branches.</l>
      </lg>
        </div>
    </body>
  </text>

